## Block: the Red ready clone does not type check

`apps/storytime/__tests__/phase3-readalong-ui.test.tsx` line 38:

```ts
copy.approval.images = { status: "approved" };
```

The JSON module type of w01 gives `approval.images` four required fields: `status`, `date`, `words`, and `source`. The object literal has one. TypeScript reports TS2739. The file is a committed Red test, so Green may not edit it.

Fix in the Red test:

```ts
copy.approval.images = { ...copy.approval.images, status: "approved" };
```

The same spread keeps `audio` and `song` safe if their source shape grows.

## Disposition

- The implementation stays uncommitted. Task 3.3 stays `[~]`.
- Green requests the one-line Red fix. After it lands, Green reruns the app type check and commits the implementation and the plan evidence.
